{
  "file_id": "3578",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 81,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Hey, guys, let's go to\nPuppetmon's mansion.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9992,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Vamos, chicos, a la\nmansión de Puppetmon."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We'll lead the way!",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10038,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Iremos delante!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I doubt he'll just be waiting for\nus. He'll most likely challenge us\nto a fight.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10058,
      "_bytes": 80,
      "translation": "Dudo que se quede quieto.\nSeguro que nos reta a\nluchar."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Wait! He's an Ultimate, you know!\nIt's not gonna be easy to defeat\nhim...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10139,
      "_bytes": 73,
      "translation": "¡Espera! ¡Es Cuerpo Supremo!\nNo será fácil vencerlo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "But we're gonna have to face him\nin the end, no matter what...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10213,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Pero al final tendremos\nque enfrentarlo, pase lo\nque pase..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Well, let's just see how it goes.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10276,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Bueno, veamos qué pasa."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "All right!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10310,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "This way!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10321,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Por aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10331,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10335,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Sora..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Well, if you say so... we don't\nhave any other options.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10343,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "Bueno, si tú lo dices...\nno hay más opciones."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Don't worry about it. If something\nbad happens, Koromon and I will\nstop them.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10399,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "No te preocupes. Si algo\nsale mal, Koromon y yo\nlos pararemos."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "And when it does, you need to take\nthe others and get out of there.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10477,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Y cuando pase, saca a\nlos demás de ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10545,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I'm counting on you.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10555,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Cuento contigo."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Okay.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10576,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Vale."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "So that's Puppetmon's mansion,\nhuh? Looks like there's two guards\nout there.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10582,
      "_bytes": 78,
      "translation": "¿Así que esa es la mansión\nde Puppetmon? Parece\nque hay dos guardias fuera."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "They ain't nothin'! We'll show 'em\nwhat we're made of!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10661,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡No son nada! ¡Ya veréis\nde qué pasta estamos\nhechos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Hold it! We don't know what else\nmight be inside, so I'll go first.\nYou guys wait here.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10716,
      "_bytes": 87,
      "translation": "¡Alto! No sabemos qué más\nhabrá dentro, así que voy\nyo primero. Esperad aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I'll go in with you! I already\nknow what's in there!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10804,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "¡Voy contigo! ¡Ya sé lo\nque hay ahí dentro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10857,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Sí, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Are you still gonna treat me like\na kid?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10870,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Aún me vas a tratar como\na un crío?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Well...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10911,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Pues..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Let's go in together, Tai.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10919,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Vamos a entrar juntos, Tai."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I agree as well.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10949,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "Yo también."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Okay. We'll go in together.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10966,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Vale. Entramos juntos."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Now!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10994,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Huh? What monstrosity is this--",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10999,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Qué es esta monstruosidad--?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Aaaargh! What're you doing?!",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11031,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Aaaargh! ¡¿Qué hacéis?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "You're Puppetmon's minions,\naren't you?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11060,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Sois esbirros de\nPuppetmon, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Forsooth, we are not!",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11102,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡No lo somos, cierto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "We're not his minions!",
      "speaker_id": 4431,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11124,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡No somos esbirros!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "So then what are you?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11147,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¿Entonces qué sois?"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "We sought a playmate of worth on\nthe other side...",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11169,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Buscábamos un digno\ncompañero de juego..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Ah, verily. Puppetmon hath no\nfriends, forsooth.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11220,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Cierto es. Puppetmon no\ntiene amigos."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "So? Is Puppetmon there or not?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11271,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¿Bueno? ¿Está Puppetmon\nahí o no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Hath no hair or hide of him.",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11304,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Ni rastro de él."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Forsooth! Well, Delumon, thou\nshalt be our guide.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11333,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Cierto! Pues Deramon,\ntú serás nuestra guía."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Verily!",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11383,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Cierto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Who's gonna be my next playmate?",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11391,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¿Quién será mi próximo compañero?"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "We were waiting for you,\nPuppetmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11424,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Te esperábamos,\nPuppetmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "You... What are *you* doing here?!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11462,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Tú... ¡¿Qué haces TÚ aquí?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Gyaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 4441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11497,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Time to settle the score,\nPuppetmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11506,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Hora de ajustar cuentas,\nPuppetmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Hmph! Fine! If you wanna play with\nme that badly, then let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11545,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Ja! ¡Bien! ¡Si tantas ganas\ntienes de jugar, pues vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11610,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11613,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Ack!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11621,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Ack!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Hahaha! You mooooorooooooons!\nSee, T.K? I was telling the\ntruth!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11626,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡Jajaja! ¡Sois unos\nboboooobos! ¿Ves, T.K.?\n¡Te dije la verdad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I have friends! See? Get 'em,\nRedVeggiemon!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11694,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Tengo amigos! ¡A por\nellos, RedVeggiemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Puppetmon's gone!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11738,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Puppetmon huyó!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Where'd he go?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11758,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¿A dónde fue?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "He can't have gone *that* far.\nLet's go find him!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11773,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "No puede haber ido muy\nlejos. ¡Vamos a buscarlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We've got you now, Puppetmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11823,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Ya te tenemos, Puppetmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "They're just running left and\nright! How useless!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11855,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Solo corren de un lado a\notro! ¡Qué inútiles!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Let's go, guys!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11905,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Vamos, chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "All right, Puppetmon! Let's have\nat it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11921,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Bien, Puppetmon! ¡A por\nello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Gh...",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11963,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Gh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Be wary of the Chosen Children!",
      "speaker_id": 4401,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11969,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Cuidado con los Niños Elegidos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "If you underestimate them, even\nyou might lose, Lord Puppetmon.",
      "speaker_id": 4401,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12001,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Si los subestimas, hasta tú\npodrías perder, Señor Puppetmon."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "You're saying I might lose?",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12067,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Dices que podría perder?"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Hah, there's no way I could lose!\nTake this!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12095,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡Ja, no hay forma de que\npierda! ¡Toma esto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "He fled again!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12140,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Huyó otra vez!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Ugh!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12155,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Hah! That caught 'em off guard.\nNow's my chance...",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12160,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Ja! Eso los ha\npillado. Ahora es mi\noportunidad..."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Lord Puppetmon! Take me with\nyou!",
      "speaker_id": 4916,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12211,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Señor Puppetmon! ¡Lléveme\nconsigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Shut up! You'll only be a\nnuisance!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12247,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Cállate! ¡Solo serás un\nestorbo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Wasn't he supposed to be a friend\nof yours?",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12283,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¿No se suponía que era\namigo tuyo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "W-Who's there?!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12327,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡¿Quién va?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Oh! Nice timing! Hey, why don't\nyou go up against those guys?",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12343,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "¡Vaya! ¡Qué oportuno! Oye,\n¿por qué no luchas contra\nesos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 2251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12405,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Hey! Aren't you listening?",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12409,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Oye! ¿No estás escuchando?"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Do you *seriously* think I'd\nlisten to someone who just\nstraight-up murders his friends?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12436,
      "_bytes": 88,
      "translation": "¿En serio crees que voy\na escuchar a quien\nasesina a sus amigos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "What did you just say? You're\ngetting on my nerves!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12525,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¿Qué acabas de decir? ¡Me\nestás sacando de quicio!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Cocytus Breath!",
      "speaker_id": 2251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12577,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Soplo Cocytus!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaagh!",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12593,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaargh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "J-Jureimon...",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12605,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "J-Jureimon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "What was it... that I was\nmissing...?",
      "speaker_id": 3061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12619,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¿Qué era... lo que me\nfaltaba...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Matt!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12657,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12665,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12669,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Matt..."
    }
  ]
}